[Music]  hello and welcome to Playstation grenade  battle royale has had yet another huge  update from the outside it may just seem  like it's a christmas event but it goes  much deeper than that  let's quickly have a look through 11 new  things brought in in patch 1.1 one  visually the biggest change is the  Christmas theme running through the  world trees and bushes are now  surrounded by Christmas lights and the  grenade launcher has had a new skin and  new animations added to create a  snowball launcher that will bring a  little festive cheer to your explosive  murder sprees the battle bus has also  had a visual overhaul spreading a little  more Christmas cheer but this isn't the  best thing about the new update it's all  about season 2 running between December  14th to February 20th season 2 will  allow players to unlock rewards as they  gain experience points at regular level  intervals cosmetic items are rewarded  these will be vanity items and shouldn't  change the game in any fundamental way  here's the best bit though those of us  who don't have the cash to put into  battle royale can still unlocked vanity  items to stand out from the crowd so you  shouldn't see the exact same Roman  reigns or Halle Berry in every single  fight this will also make it easy for  everyone to track who you are fighting  those of us with the base game can earn  VIII bucks to unlock the rewards in the  premium section just below the free  section and of course if you've got zero  control and a credit card you could buy  everything for real pounds real dollars  or real euros expect to be given a small  amount of ebooks in the free levels to  give you a taste of spending them on  premium gear of course the publisher  wants your money and hopes to [ __ ] you  early on oh and I think we should look  at the small print to future seasons  we'll be real money star purchases  fingers crossed those people who bought  the founder's pack won't be shafted in  future seasons time will tell I suppose  to be eligible for the premium content  you will require a battle pass which  will be half-price for season two coming  in at 950 bucks  this will unlock the premium content  you'll be grinding towards there's a  pretty cool item  receive right away the blue Squire  outfit looks mighty impressive and in  addition to this you will get an extra  daily challenge slot alongside other XP  boosts from that point your only job is  to play the hell out of fox night battle  royale and earn those rewards which  range from gliders freakin brilliant  harvesting tools and even the occasional  emote okay I admit it I really want this  emot-- the backpack kid is my hero he's  everyone's hero isn't he  there's more than 65 unlockable items to  get your hands on over the season which  ends on February 20th the devs put the  amount of time needed to unlock all  these items at between 75 and 150 hours  of in-game massacring and building if  you've got the V bucks you can unlock  everything immediately I was thinking  about buying all the vanity items to  showcase them in a video but I kind of  feel that might be a bit click of a T  let me know your thoughts and I'll  definitely consider it the patch notes  also reveal a plethora of mini changes  to the game let's fly through them as  quickly as possible a new sliding  animation has been added in an attempt  to fix the issue with mountain surfing  it's only a first step so the random  damage you may take will probably still  be around for a few months yet who is a  good one grenade throws now have a  trajectory path overlaid for Rd  precision very much needed indeed any  new players coming to Battle Royale will  be given the combat pro controller type  as a default but don't worry if you  don't use this whatever you currently  have set in game will remain that way  have you ever had that issue where you  shoot someone in the head with a shotgun  and it only takes off six health from  their stack very annoying isn't it well  incorrect damage figures are being  patched out so maybe just maybe that  will happen a little less now another  quality of life improvement comes in the  shape of those loot chests that you see  from a distance that seem to be  completely intact but then you walk  closer and they suddenly pop open and  you've wasted your time this shouldn't  happen at all anymore it's been patched  out halle-bloody-lujah  legendary assault rifles have a 25% less  chance of being found in the open now so  supply drops will once again be your  main focus for high quality gear again  oh here's another one for all you  console gamers the aim assist on snipers  has been removed allowing you to track  and lead your target for better headshot  accuracy  oh one more last thing and it's the  biggest thing you can ever imagine  footballs and basketballs now bounce and  roll much smoother so set up a makeshift  Court or go to the football field and  enjoy a bit of a kick around and there  we have it 11 new things in Fox night  battle royale patch 1.07 are 1.11 how do  you say it anyway please let me know if  you're thinking of buying the battle  pass and what you think about future  seasons being all about real money I'm  not sure about that one I'm Adam from  Playstation grenade have a freaking  brilliant Christmas and I'll see you  soon it's been a pleasure see you next  time

